{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03988","headline":"晦日宴高氏林亭 · 周彦昭","name":"晦日宴高氏林亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"胜地临鸡浦，高会偶龙沙。\n御柳惊春色，仙筇掩月华。\n门邀千里驭，杯泛九光霞。\n日落山亭晚，雷送七香车。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"周彦昭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03988.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03988","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}